@@@ note
An item holding two paragraphs keeps the blank line between them — that is what makes the
list loose in the first place.

@@@ input
- first paragraph of the item

  second paragraph of the item

- next item

@@@ wrap 80
- first paragraph of the item

  second paragraph of the item

- next item

@@@ wrap 30
- first paragraph of the item

  second paragraph of the item

- next item

@@@ unwrap
- first paragraph of the item

  second paragraph of the item

- next item
